New-Hire Onboarding Concierge (ORBIT V4)

Tech Stack:
FastAPI, SQLite, JWT Authentication

Overview

ORBIT V4 is an AI-powered employee onboarding management system designed to automate and track the onboarding process. It uses an orchestrator agent to coordinate tasks and provides real-time progress monitoring.

Features

- Orchestrator Agent with 8 sequential onboarding tasks
- Real-time dashboard updates with auto-refresh
- Separate HR and Manager interfaces
- Retry mechanism for failed tasks (maximum 3 attempts)
- Complete action logging and history tracking
- Professional enterprise-style user interface
- JWT-based authentication
- SQLite database for persistent storage

Workflow

HR Login → Create Employee → Start Onboarding

1. Account Creation
2. IT Asset Setup
3. HR Document Signing
4. Manager Introduction
5. Workspace Assignment
6. Training Enrollment
7. Policy Acknowledgment
8. Welcome Kit Dispatch

Onboarding Status:
Pending → In Progress → Completed

Failure Handling:
Failed → Retry → Pending → In Progress → Completed

User Roles

HR:

- Create employees
- View all tasks
- Access logs
- Delete employees

Manager:

- View team members
- Monitor onboarding tasks
- Retry failed tasks
- View task details

Database Schema

Users:

- id
- username
- password
- role
- created_at

Employees:

- id
- user_id
- name
- email
- department
- status
- created_at

Tasks:

- id
- employee_id
- task_name
- status
- retry_count
- executed_at
- error_msg

Logs:

- id
- employee_id
- action
- timestamp
- user_role

Onboarding Tasks

1. Account Creation
2. IT Asset Setup
3. HR Document Signing
4. Manager Introduction
5. Workspace Assignment
6. Training Enrollment
7. Policy Acknowledgment
8. Welcome Kit Dispatch

Technology Stack

Backend:

- Python 3.9+
- FastAPI
- SQLite
- JWT
- Uvicorn

Frontend:

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript (ES6)
- Fetch API
- Auto polling using setInterval

Installation

git clone https://github.com/shansree-z/Orbit_V4.git

cd Orbit_V4

python -m venv venv

Windows:
venv\Scripts\activate

Mac/Linux:
source venv/bin/activate

pip install -r requirements.txt

python init_db.py

uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000

Docker

docker build -t orbit-v4 .

docker run -p 8000:8000 orbit-v4

Application URLs

HR Dashboard:
http://localhost:8000

Manager Dashboard:
http://localhost:8000/manager

API Documentation:
http://localhost:8000/docs

Default Credentials

HR:
Username: hr@orbit.com
Password: hr123

Manager:
