API Endpoints

POST /api/login

POST /api/employees

GET /api/employees

GET /api/employees/{id}/tasks

POST /api/tasks/{id}/retry

GET /api/logs

Logging

The system records:

- User logins
- Employee creation
- Task execution events
- Task failures
- Task retries
- Status updates

